      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e4",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_10",
      "quote": "As shown in Fig 1, most studies included a computational system dynamics simulation model (n = 21; 66%), while the remaining studies (n = 11; 34%) used only diagramming approaches... Study topics were clustered around several themes...",
      "reason": "The review specifies groups used for synthesis, such as model type (simulation vs diagramming) and study topics, which are used to analyze characteristics and quality."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "This search period was selected to reflect recent developments and current applications of system dynamics modeling related to cancer.",
      "reason": "The manuscript provides rationales for notable restrictions on eligibility, such as the 10-year publication window and the exclusion of pathogenesis-only studies."
    }
